    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "redefining mission sounds like something from a self help book... it doesnt work like that. once you've lost the thing that made you *you*, you can't just pick up some hobby and feel whole again. it's not just a \"lack of purpose,\" it's like the light just went out. everything feels so heavy for no reason. it's exhausting to even pretend to be a person anymore.",
