      "content": "professional support... i've done that. it's all just talk. everyone tells me there's more to life than my career or my skills, but that's just a lie to keep people moving. if you aren't contributing anything, if you're just taking up space and resources, why bother? it feels like i'm just a void where a person used to be. just an empty shell.",
